                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bialgebra+cocycle"} bialgebra cocycle
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Drinfel%27d+twist"} Drinfel'd twist
                %li
                  %p by the way how does one download the source of a previous version ? I sometimes create a page and then there are changes after and I want to have my file for other purposes with what I wrote and I do not know how to access it.
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"} John
              %ul
                %li
                  I did some work on the
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Timeline+of+category+theory+and+related+mathematics"} Timeline of category theory and related mathematics
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs
              %ul
                %li
